    "name": "base-repos/base-compose",
    "descriptionZh": "base 框架的插件，把多个 generator 的 data / options / helpers / views 有选择地合并到当前应用实例上，要先注册 base-generators。",
    "takeawayZh": "app.use(compose()) 合并多个生成器",
    "noteZh": "仓库落点是 base-repos/base-compose（简报里的 node-base/base-compose 会跳过来），About 写 Compose elements from multiple applications into one.，README 标 MIT license。装法是 $ npm install --save base-compose，且必须先注册 base-generators；用法是 var compose = require('base-compose'); var app = new Base(); app.use(compose());，随后 app.compose(base, ['a','b','c']).data().options().helpers().views()。API 一节逐个列出 .compose 和 .compose.options 等方法，并说明缺插件时 base-compose 会给出详细报错。仓库 69 次提交、4 star、0 fork、3 个 tag，Used by 9.6K，Sponsor this project 区挂着 jonschlinkert 和 doowb。",
    "recommendation": null,
